        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Parsifal, Manon\n- People: Richard Wagner, Jules Massenet, Henri Meilhac, Philippe Gille, Abbé Prévost\n- Topics: Opera, opéra comique, libretti, source novels\n\nFacts:\n- In 1731, Abbé Prévost published the novel \"L’histoire du chevalier des Grieux et de Manon Lescaut.\"\n- Parsifal is an opera in three acts by German composer Richard Wagner.\n- Manon is an opéra comique in five acts by Jules Massenet.\n- Manon has a French libretto by Henri Meilhac and Philippe Gille.\n- Manon is based on Abbé Prévost’s 1731 novel \"L’histoire du chevalier des Grieux et de Manon Lescaut.\"",
